<title>JAPAN: Chiyoda wins order to build plant in Indonesia.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda wins order to build plant in Indonesia.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiyoda Corp said on Friday that it and an Indonesian contractor have jointly won a 12 billion yen order to build a fertiliser plant from Indonesia's PT Pupuk Kalimantan Timur.</p>
<p>In cooperation with its partner PT Rekayasa Industri, Chiyoda hopes to complete the Indonesia plant by the end of 1998, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Its production capacity will be 1,725 tonnes of fertiliser per day, the statement said.</p>
</text>
